    "id": "90000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000317",
    "title": "Letters to a Daughter and A Little Sermon to School Girls",
    "description": "The public-domain text of Letters to a Daughter and A Little Sermon to School Girls by Helen Ekin Starrett, preserved across 1 original section with extracted Scripture references.",
    "total_days": 20,
